WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:07,270
Take the shark fin back and soak it in water for one to three days.

2
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:09,270
Be sure to simmer on low heat when cooking

3
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:11,270
Don't let it boil

4
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,270
Boss Jin

5
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,270
Do you have any other good stuff on hand?

6
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:15,270
I took it all together

7
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:17,270
I haven't received anything lately

8
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:19,270
But if Boss Jin wants to buy it,

9
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:22,270
I can ask the fishermen to think of ways to pay more attention

10
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,530
Forget it

11
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:25,820
I'd better look elsewhere

12
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,550
Boss Jin

13
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,550
Do you want the best dried egg Haishen?

14
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:32,220
Freshly dried and of high quality

15
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,220
How much does it cost per pound?

16
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,220
Let’s not talk about money first

17
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,220
You look at things first

18
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:49,460
Once the items are suitable, we can discuss the price.

19
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,460
Why don’t you have any salt on your sea squire?

20
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:53,460
There are three main ways in which HiSen deals with

21
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,460
Steel salt, dried salt and dried eggs

22
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:58,460
No matter which of these three methods, salt is indispensable

23
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,460
So after handling it

24
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:01,460
There is salt sucked out from the outside of Haishen

25
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,620
Enter the dried egg he brought

26
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:04,620
No salt was sucked out

27
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:05,620
This is a friend of mine from Hainan

28
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,620
Teach me new ways to deal with

29
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:09,620
It says it’s called New Craft Egg Dried Eggs

30
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:10,620
Haishen made in this way

31
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:13,620
The shape is more regular than the old way

32
00:01:13,620 --> 00:01:14,620
Uniform color

33
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:17,620
And there is no residue of impurities such as plant ash and salt.

34
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:19,620
It tastes much better than before

35
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:23,730
Haishen handled it really well.

36
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:25,730
My old man has been selling fish for so many years.

37
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,730
I’ve never seen such a bright orange color

38
00:01:27,730 --> 00:01:28,730
Boss Jin, look

39
00:01:28,730 --> 00:01:30,730
This thorn, this fleshy elasticity

40
00:01:30,730 --> 00:01:34,650
I want all these sea squires

41
00:01:34,650 --> 00:01:37,600
One hundred and fifty pounds

42
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:38,600
It was processed before

43
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,600
One pound only costs 100 to 120 yuan.

44
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:44,270
Zhang Jianguo’s goods cost a full thirty yuan.
